{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29120","headline":"病间寄郡中文士 · 许浑","name":"病间寄郡中文士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卢橘含花处处香，老人依旧卧清漳。\n心同客舍惊秋早，迹似僧斋厌夜长。\n风卷翠帘琴自响，露凝朱阁簟先凉。\n明朝欲醉文中彦，犹觉吟声带越乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29120.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29120","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}